Queue Hierarchy & Operations: 

Queue -----> ArrayDeque
        |--> LinkedList

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
| Safe Methods (No Exception) | Exception-Throwing Methods |
|-----------------------------|----------------------------|
| peek()                      | element()                  |
| offer(e)                    | add(e)                     |
| poll()                      | remove()                   |
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

